  "solution": {
    "text": "We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><msqrt><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Put in&nbsp;equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><msqrt><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>We know&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>From equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>64</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>145</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>145</mn><mn>144</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>145</mn></msqrt><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
